f=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span> →\n        <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mk</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span> → <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Slice.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice\">Int16Array.Slice</a></span></span>) →\n          <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(∀ (<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>) (<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span>), <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mk</span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">h</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.InPlace.Tail\">InPlace.Tail</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span> <span class=\"fn\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">γ</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Runs a tail program on the elements of the slice `s`, for a size `n` of `s`, in place in the\nslice's array. `t N off hw mk hmk` is a program on the array, of size `N`, that works on the window\nof `n` elements at `off`, where `hw` bounds the window; its continuation builds the new slice with\n`mk a' h`, on the new array `a'`, of size `n` by `hmk`. When the array's size is less than\n`USize.size`, `off` is the slice's start. `inplace s do …` runs its programs on slices this way.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice.runInPlaceThenOf","kind":"def","line":1712,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice.runInPlaceThenOf","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int16/Program.lean#L1712-L1730"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice.toNat_toUSize_start_add_le\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">toNat_toUSize_start_add_le</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Slice.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice\">Int16Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Slice.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice.start\">start</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#Nat.toUSize\">toUSize</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Slice.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice.array\">array</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.size\">size</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The window of the slice at `s.start.toUSize` fits in its array.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice.toNat_toUSize_start_add_le","kind":"theorem","line":1703,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Slice.toNat_toUSize_start_add_le","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int16/Program.lean#L1703-L1710"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThenOf_eq\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">runInPlaceThenOf_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">γ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.InPlace.Tail\">InPlace.Tail</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">γ</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThenOf\">runInPlaceThenOf</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">h</span> <span class=\"fn\">t</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">t</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.InPlace.Tail.run\">run</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">h</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThenOf_eq","kind":"theorem","line":1696,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThenOf_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int16/Program.lean#L1696-L1699"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThenOf\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">runInPlaceThenOf</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">γ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.InPlace.Tail\">InPlace.Tail</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">γ</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">γ</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Runs the tail program `t` on `a`, for a size `n` of `a`: `t.run a h`. When `n` is a variable bound\nto `a.size` before the program, the program's types don't mention `a`, so that the compiler doesn't\nkeep `a` alive through the program: if it did, the array would no longer be exclusive when the\nprogram makes it so, and it would be copied. `inplace a do …` runs its programs this way.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThenOf","kind":"def","line":1685,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThenOf","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int16/Program.lean#L1685-L1694"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThen_eq\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">runInPlaceThen_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">γ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.InPlace.Tail\">InPlace.Tail</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.size\">size</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">γ</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThen\">runInPlaceThen</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">t</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">t</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.InPlace.Tail.run\">run</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">⋯</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThen_eq","kind":"theorem","line":1680,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThen_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int16/Program.lean#L1680-L1683"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.runInPlaceThen\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">runInPlaceThen</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">γ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Program.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.InPlace.Tail\">InPlace.Tail</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.siz